  m_text: "Navigate the fractured dimensions to reach the yellow portal.\n\n\nCONTROLS
    (PC): Left and Right Buttons : Move Left / Right\n\n [Up Arrow] : Jump,  [Circle
    Button ] : TOGGLE REALITY\n\n\nGAMEPLAY RULES:\n\nOrange platforms only exist
    in REALITY A.\n\nBlue platforms only exist in REALITY B.\n\nUse [Circle Button
    which has icon] to switch worlds instantly.\n\nConservation of Momentum: You
    keep your speed when switching!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
