  m_text: "Navigate the fractured dimensions to reach the yellow portal.\n\n\nCONTROLS
    (PC): [A] / [D] or [Arrows] : Move Left / Right\n\n [SPACE] : Jump,  [SHIFT]
    or [Q] : TOGGLE REALITY\n\n\nGAMEPLAY RULES:\n\nOrange platforms only exist in
    REALITY A.\n\nBlue platforms only exist in REALITY B.\n\nUse [SHIFT] to switch
    worlds instantly.\n\nConservation of Momentum: You keep your speed when switching!"
